{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1000_null", "source_sha256": "b4f24ebe1c428c127a2183bf44fd02461be07e4563a75d567b4838fa13a9f2dd", "ja": "定期公演　数日前……", "zh": "定期公演　几天前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1001_p", "source_sha256": "42173b032333abfbbd9a7cddf124710c0c2faf047122f2baf82677e34a267113", "ja": "ご両親が、娘さんの将来を真剣に考えられている\nという事は、もちろんわかっています。ですが……。", "zh": "我当然明白，二位是在认真考虑女儿的将来。\n可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1002_p", "source_sha256": "292667b1fdfea75782d0e24681a8f02f197f0ed252ddad4b4ce2ba80ce97d0f3", "ja": "どうか静香さんの可能性を信じて、もう少しの間、\n見守っていただけませんでしょうか？", "zh": "恳请您相信静香的可能性，再多守望她一段时间，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3b8f51af374dd7fb221268100afc00697d3971e45082d06c097a4b51696f8954", "ja": "ここまで頑張って、結果を出してきたんです。\nその地道な努力の芽を、摘み取らないで欲しいんです。", "zh": "她一路努力到现在，也已经取得了成果。\n请不要扼杀那份脚踏实地的努力所萌发的嫩芽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1004_sizukatiti", "source_sha256": "bfb9563288e3f3b9ec4576b2dd75d1a6dc7d196ba2d4874924102c424759d33c", "ja": "親に反対されたくらいで簡単に揺らぐようでは、\n到底トップアイドルになどなれない、と考えますが。", "zh": "如果只是被父母反对就轻易动摇的话，\n根本不可能成为顶级偶像——我是这么认为的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1005_p", "source_sha256": "99c642526ecd0c5c7b7bf5e7eb6a555bd19a9adf0291a30082be59cb9cf75bf0", "ja": "お言葉ですが、中学生にとって父親の一言は絶大です。\nそれこそ、育ててきたものを、失いかねない程には。", "zh": "恕我直言，对中学生来说，父亲的一句话影响是极其巨大的。甚至可能会因此失去一直以来培养起来的一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7861483683974d34ea63f8f7d10c9ab59df4a9b805bc9c25c0d8a26feecb4329", "ja": "大人の役目は、子供の夢を奪う事じゃない。\n守る事なんです！　だから……。", "zh": "大人的职责，不是去剥夺孩子的梦想。\n而是去守护它！所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6b1c8dc4b7c823760ecd482385b48a25e51759e1e284a373b1f28c49a18d8b99", "ja": "「アイドルは中学生まで」という約束……\nどうか、考え直してください！　お願いします！！", "zh": "“当偶像只能到初中为止”这个约定……\n请您务必再重新考虑一下！拜托了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1010_p", "source_sha256": "247b81f91f2ed42c7296daed1fe1881554576104f9ed1f78d62a2b724c3f81e3", "ja": "（……静香のブログを読んでいると、\n公演前にお父さんと話した時の事を思い出すな）", "zh": "（……读着静香的博客，就想起了公演前和她父亲谈话时的事）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cd7d75670fc6a192a99b5476597f63524797163eae34ce98114b80e4f19ddbd2", "ja": "（結局、最良の返事はもらえなかったけど……\nまだまだこれからだ。何度でも説得して……ん？）", "zh": "（结果还是没能得到最理想的答复……\n不过，今后还有的是机会。无论多少次我都会继续说服她……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "4fc148d53c275ba0550e0a06b03da51ebd2fd0838626b4c91e3212264bc8d25d", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\n……{$P$}？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n……{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "b70468b4bb7c98b0b9ae4434e18251b92e422759dca6a08397212fe0365b20ff", "ja": "なんだかぼんやりしてるみたいですけど……\n大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "好像有点发呆……\n没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1014_p", "source_sha256": "933638f1164aab449d645bb569136a974241c0bf3317809e7be1ca21fe4747fa", "ja": "あ、ああ、静香。いや、ちょうど静香のブログを\n読んでたんだ。決意表明、しっかり受け取ったぞ！", "zh": "啊、啊啊，静香。没什么，我刚好在看你的博客。你的决心宣言，我已经好好收到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "e6317816f2247716b4ba0a7a33163a2e4a76190460ee08e6cc30d07d64c4549a", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。今の私の、\n正直な気持ちを書いたので……すこし、照れますね。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您。因为写下了现在我真实的心情……所以，稍微有点害羞呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "2eb9e8f3f5e0f4caee18cdaae9d5329d901062bc3c255f95b87fad7c064b8034", "ja": "でも……あの父が、「アイドルは中学を卒業するまで」\nという約束を、いったん保留してくれるなんて……。", "zh": "可是……没想到父亲居然愿意暂时搁置“偶像做到初中毕业为止”这个约定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1640083641a780e76df18a861cf624f4b30c050f4a66f6c9efad8af4697bfec6", "ja": "お父さんの言うレベルまで達していないにせよ、\n静香はちゃんと結果を出しているからな。", "zh": "即使还没达到她父亲所说的标准，静香也确实拿出了成绩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5f59c99941312f679655612a27e98cc7f22d27260592e85d9b1ee5b0b8cd72fd", "ja": "反対でも、無理矢理諦めさせるのは、得策じゃない。\nそう納得してくれたんだと思うよ。", "zh": "即使反对，也不该强行让她放弃。  \n我想，他应该就是这样接受了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "c06994c833b157630b0c99da57f4e91fe8a889a3aa8b2aaad63e3d96b1ed56b2", "ja": "ええ。「アイドル活動に反対な事は変わらない」なんて\n言ってましたけど、まさか内緒で観に来てたなんて。", "zh": "是啊。他明明还说过“反对偶像活动这件事不会改变”，没想到竟然瞒着我们来看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1020_p", "source_sha256": "52e931cbd6b495b1903d1b33608070ee82e7bd401ea1d4daf1dcfa0da3232632", "ja": "まぁ、そう言うな。あの日の静香のステージを\n見たからこそ、保留にしてもらえたんだと思うよ。", "zh": "好啦，别这么说。正因为看到了那天静香的舞台，我想他们才同意暂缓决定吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "ad1edd12119e5b17930c56a966a9afea283297a2dd1a162b63bceb521680765a", "ja": "……。\nこれも、{$P$}のおかげですね。", "zh": "……。\n这也是多亏了{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "38efc782d618d3ad5b0e7bcf3a2b153c88b902a647ffc07340b1cea7e1d72906", "ja": "新曲をくれたこと、父と向き合ってくれたこと……\nすごく、うれしかったです。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "您给我新歌，还愿意面对我的父亲……\n我真的非常开心。谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1023_p", "source_sha256": "5a3181eb8de1397627b4cc55b9c9096ae8595c069c8066674428b03080acfbc6", "ja": "当然だよ。\n俺は静香のプロデューサーだからな。", "zh": "这是理所当然的。\n因为我是静香的制作人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1024_p", "source_sha256": "dc901f6c6ddd6f6e1ccdcefe5927adc5eed67d6b90ec2d334b7304766c7597d9", "ja": "今はまだ、反対されたままだけど……保留じゃなく\n撤回してもらえるまで、一緒に頑張ろうな！", "zh": "现在还依然遭到反对……在让他们撤回反对之前，我们一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_067_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "4a540edb66455f796571c5a0400d2866202afe755bcb611488f527a605911191", "ja": "はいっ！　そのためにも、プロデュースの手を\n緩めたりしないでくださいね？　約束ですよ♪", "zh": "好的！为了实现这个目标，制作人也不能放松对我的培养哦？说好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
